{"c":[{"name":"20261003T191104Z-a560fe18d0d7ba87","text":"Balanced allows 4 offers an hour (settings.ts LEVELS): a socket test that needs a fifth pop-up sends settings level eager first, or the gate silently holds it (B17).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T191104Z-ec0243a8194ed7a7","text":"Live Jev picks a typed About Name/Email in both asks but at 0.23-0.88, under the 0.75 fill cutoff, on standalone forms (B17 held-out: 1-3 of 17 filled, 0 wrong); three prompt rewordings on a dev set did not raise it (evidence/screen/b17/dev).","type":"note"}]}
